// tui/widget forwards every name its component packages export (<name>_facade.go, generated by
// internal/facadegen from facadegen.Packages), each marked Deprecated, so a program importing
// tui/widget compiles unchanged while it moves to the packages. TestTheFacadeIsGenerated fails when
// a package exports a name the facade does not forward yet.

